# What **not** to do now

❌ Don't implement the real Notification service before anything uses it.

❌ Don't build the Activity table before there's meaningful activity to record.

❌ Don't spend days optimizing duplicate checks if you currently have a small dataset.

Those are all valid improvements, but they become much more valuable once the CRM workflow is complete.

