## One recommendation before you go much further

Before building **Pricing**, spend a little time talking to Bonzer's operations or business team (or whoever defines the workflow) about:

* What data a quotation actually needs.
* How revisions are handled.
* What happens if a customer negotiates.
* When a job is officially considered "created."
* Which documents are mandatory at each stage.

Those decisions have a big impact on the schema and workflow. Spending a few hours validating them now can save a lot of rework later.


